<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Green Tree rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Green Tree rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said it raised the rating on Green Tree Financial Corp to strong buy from outperform</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available</p>
<p>-- Green Tree was up 7/8 to 28-3/8 in early trading</p>
